libafdt
------------------------------------------
libafdt is a library for performing asynchronous file descriptor transfers
using libevent.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libafdt-devel-0.1.0+git20181207-1bl2
  libafdt0-0.1.0+git20181207-1bl2
  libevent2.1_7-2.1.13-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libevent-devel-2.1.13-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/facebookarchive/libafdt

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/facebookarchive/libafdt.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libafdt-0.1.0+git20181207-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libafdt-0.1.0+git20181207-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libafdt-0.1.0+git20181207-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libafdt-0.1.0+git20181207-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libafdt0-0.1.0+git20181207-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libafdt-devel-0.1.0+git20181207-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libafdt)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libafdt.README
  /usr/share/doc/libafdt/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libafdt/PATENTS
  /usr/share/doc/libafdt/README

(libafdt0)
  /usr/bin/cygafdt-0.dll

(libafdt-devel)
  /usr/include/afdt.h
  /usr/lib/libafdt.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libafdt.pc

